---
import howToFindUs from '../assets/how-to-find-us.png';
---

<section id="venue" class="wrap section venue">
  <h2 class="section-title">
    How to <strong>find us</strong>
  </h2>

  <p class="venue__address">
    <svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12S4 16 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/>
      <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
    </svg>
    Cohort Innovation Space — 16 Nexus Way, Southport QLD 4215
  </p>

  <div class="venue__map-wrap">
    <img
      src={howToFindUs.src}
      width={howToFindUs.width}
      height={howToFindUs.height}
      alt="How to find the AWS User Group Gold Coast at Cohort Innovation Space, 16 Nexus Way Southport. Step 1: look for the colourful building with the COHORT sign and enter there. Step 2: once inside, turn left — the Board-room sign is where the room is. The map shows the route along Nexus Way from Griffith University tram stop."
      class="venue__map"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="venue__tips">
    <div class="venue__tip">
      <span class="venue__tip-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <p>Look for the <strong>colourful building</strong> with the COHORT sign — enter through the front.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="venue__tip">
      <span class="venue__tip-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <p>Once inside, <strong>turn left</strong>. Follow the Board-room sign — that's where we meet.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="venue__tip">
      <span class="venue__tip-num venue__tip-num--transit" aria-hidden="true">🚌</span>
      <p>By tram: <strong>Griffith University</strong> stop (Gold Coast Light Rail) is a short walk south on Nexus Way.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a
    class="venue__maps-link"
    href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Cohort+Innovation+Space,+16+Nexus+Way,+Southport+QLD+4215"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
  >
    Open in Google Maps →
  </a>
</section>

<style>
  .venue__address {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--c-amber);
    margin-block: 8px 28px;
  }

  .venue__map-wrap {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lift);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .venue__map {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .venue__tips {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .venue__tip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 18px 20px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .venue__tip-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c-gold);
    color: var(--c-dark);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .venue__tip-num--transit {
    background: var(--c-sand);
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .venue__tip p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--c-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .venue__tip p strong {
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }

  .venue__maps-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-amber);
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .venue__maps-link:hover {
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }
</style>
